---
description: Do not bake every dialect driver into committed package manifests.
alwaysApply: true
---

# migrate-init owns driver dependencies

Do not add all datasource driver dependencies to committed package manifests or project references (`package.json`, `Cargo.toml`, `PackageReference`s, `dialects.props`). That makes published and vendored bundles too large.

`migrate-init --language … --dialect …` is what attaches dialect projects and installs their drivers. Each dialect is its own package/project/crate that owns the one driver reference. The core runner has none. A full local set is `--all`, not a committed kitchen-sink dependency list.
